# LOW-SPEED PROFILE for the 1 kg/250 mm airframe (2026-11-26).  The 1.35 m/s path is NOT flown with the 8 m/s
# bench gains: MEASURED phase9a/9b/9c (bench5 firmware) 2-4 truth loops per sortie where the truth speed spikes
# to 1.9 m/s against a 1.1 m/s command, i.e. the stiff 8 m/s loop overshoots low-speed handover transients.
# This profile is the low-speed counterpart: gentle attitude/rate loop, soft position/velocity loop, and
# WP_SPD/WP_ACC that match the 1.35 m/s delivery instead of the speed ladder.
WP_SPD       1.5
WP_ACC       2.0
WP_JERK      8.0
WP_RADIUS_M  0.3
ATC_ANGLE_MAX 30.0
ATC_ANG_RLL_P 8.0
ATC_ANG_PIT_P 8.0
ATC_RAT_RLL_P 0.12
ATC_RAT_RLL_I 0.12
ATC_RAT_RLL_D 0.004
ATC_RAT_PIT_P 0.12
ATC_RAT_PIT_I 0.12
ATC_RAT_PIT_D 0.004
ATC_RAT_YAW_P 0.30
ATC_RAT_YAW_I 0.030
PSC_NE_POS_P 1.6
PSC_NE_VEL_P 2.2
PSC_NE_VEL_I 1.0
PSC_NE_VEL_D 0.20
PSC_NE_JERK  60.0
PSC_D_POS_P 0.8
PSC_D_VEL_P 4.0
MOT_THST_HOVER 0.39
MOT_THST_EXPO 0.65
